{"version":1,"content":"<p>曾經因嚴寒而幾乎與蚊媒疾病絕緣的拉達克，正面臨氣候變化、公共系統失靈、生計萎縮與無序旅遊疊加帶來的公共衞生風險。當地居民、醫生和研究者警告説，登革熱和瘧疾的出現，可能只是這片高海拔寒冷荒漠地區環境劇變的開始。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587108.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T09:14:56.332748+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:53:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T09:08:13.339581+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T09:08:13.339581+00:00","content_hash":"3820ec4f5545b97835258e356660840e56466e8c0b26c21344b842db8a2ff4b2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}